1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
一碗冰粉，其实是"搓"出来的
This iced jelly is hand-rubbed

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
原料，是一种树的种子
It starts from a tree's seeds

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
冰粉树，学名假酸浆
The "bingfen tree" — Nicandra

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,200
种子装进纱布，水里揉
Seeds in cloth, rubbed in water

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,500
搓出胶质，一冻就成冻
Rub out the gel, chill till set

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,800
明清就有，源自四川武阳
Since the Ming-Qing, from Sichuan

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,100
红糖、山楂、葡萄干、花生
Brown sugar, hawthorn, raisins, peanuts

8
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,400
夏夜街边，"冰粉孃孃"守着摊
Street "bingfen aunties" at night

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,700
四川话说：巴适得板
In Sichuan: "bashi de ban" — perfect

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,000
一勺下去，透心凉
One spoon, cool to the core

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,300
你吃冰粉，加不加山楂？
Iced jelly — hawthorn on top or not?

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,600
下集：收尾一碗酸梅汤
Next: closing with sour plum drink
